      <p class="_abstract">In a highly available control plane, three etcd pods run as a part of a stateful set in an etcd cluster. To recover an etcd cluster, identify unhealthy etcd pods by checking the etcd cluster health.</p>
      <h2 id="hosted-cluster-etcd-status_hcp-recovering-etcd-cluster" class="group scroll-mt-20">Checking the status of an etcd cluster<a href="#hosted-cluster-etcd-status_hcp-recovering-etcd-cluster" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">You can check the status of the etcd cluster health by logging into any etcd pod.</p>
